~ post_photo_best
Montana: Oh my gosh, it’s perfect!

Montana: You know, I’ve really been feeling like my whole life, I’ve just done what I’m supposed to do.

Montana: And I did all the right things. I worked hard, I stayed late. I even kept a pillow in the office. And they still dropped me in the end.

Montana: Earlier, I was feeling like I didn’t know if I could try again. But I didn’t know what else I could do.

Montana: But thanks to you, I feel like I can start on my own dreams.

Montana: Thank you!
=> END

